  new TableRow({ children: [cell("Packages"), cell("Raise per-client spend 30 to 50 percent, paid up front"), cell("Each Belle package runs a 49 to 83 percent margin", { alt: true })] }),
] });
C.push(t);
C.push(body("The real prize is not any single number. It is converting a seasonal, transactional practice into a business with predictable monthly cash flow. That stability lets the owner plan, hire, and invest, and it is also what makes a practice worth far more if they ever sell.", { after: 40 }));

// PART 3
C.push(sectionHeader("Part 3. How to Get Every Client on at Least One"));
C.push(body("The menu is built as a ladder, so there is a rung for every client and every budget. The operating rule is simple: no one leaves as a one-off. Every consultation and every checkout ends with the right offer attached to that specific client.", { after: 120 }));
