C.push(say("You come in for your tox every few months, and I know you have been loving your facials. Can I show you something that would actually save you money on what you are already doing?"));
C.push(label("Step 2. Make the offer, and reframe the fee"));
C.push(say("We just launched our memberships, and the one that fits you is The Belle of the Ball. It is one ninety-nine a month, but here is the part most people miss. That fee does not disappear. It banks into your Beauty Bank and you spend it on whatever you want, so you are not paying for a membership, you are pre-loading your own treatments. On top of that, you get your tox at eleven twenty-five a unit instead of thirteen fifty, fifteen percent off your filler and your skincare, and you pick a free signature facial every single month."));
